# 17. SUPABASE DATABASE SCHEMA

Create proper PostgreSQL migrations.

Suggested tables:

1. profiles
2. seasons
3. teams
4. season_teams
5. players
6. player_seasons
7. player_statistics
8. player_ratings
9. season_rules
10. custom_squads
11. squad_players
12. playing_xi
13. squad_substitutes
14. squad_ratings
15. squad_shares
